WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
Meet Morgan, founder of Ledgerly, a fictional
bookkeeping product.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.950
Morgan needs to know who to market to, and
what can honestly be said.

3
00:00:04.238 --> 00:00:07.108
Morgan opens Viable. Home answers one
question: what should I do next?

4
00:00:07.158 --> 00:00:10.028
Today: review a new market signal and keep the
launch moving.

5
00:00:10.078 --> 00:00:13.732
First, the product itself: what Ledgerly does,
and what it does not.

6
00:00:13.782 --> 00:00:17.436
Morgan is weighing two possible audiences.

7
00:00:17.486 --> 00:00:20.819
Side by side, every rating shows its evidence
and confidence. Design studios lead.

8
00:00:20.869 --> 00:00:26.078
A competitor announcement arrives. It stays a
suggestion until Morgan reviews it.

9
00:00:26.128 --> 00:00:31.337
Morgan accepts it as evidence, under their own
name.

10
00:00:31.387 --> 00:00:37.446
In Studio, Sam, the reviewer, sent the website
copy back: it overstated the claim.

11
00:00:37.496 --> 00:00:42.572
Morgan rewrites it to match what Ledgerly can
actually prove,

12
00:00:42.622 --> 00:00:47.698
then resubmits it for review.

13
00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:53.321
Sam sees the earlier request next to the new
version,

14
00:00:53.371 --> 00:00:58.944
and approves it by name. Nothing is approved
silently.

15
00:00:58.994 --> 00:01:02.822
Viable does not post for Morgan. No publishing
API is connected.

16
00:01:02.872 --> 00:01:06.701
The approved post is scheduled for Morgan to
publish by hand.

17
00:01:06.751 --> 00:01:11.848
After posting, Morgan records the delivery as
human-recorded evidence,

18
00:01:11.898 --> 00:01:16.995
not provider-verified. This record is
synthetic.

19
00:01:17.045 --> 00:01:19.906
Finally, Morgan checks the results. Missing
data stays missing, not zero,

20
00:01:19.956 --> 00:01:22.817
so the next decision rests on what was really
observed.

21
00:01:22.867 --> 00:01:24.067
From product truth to a measured result: every
step named and reviewed.

22
00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.317
Nothing in this video was published.

